<title>SPAIN: Spain's Ibex-35 to include Sol Melia, Uniasa.</title>
<headline>Spain's Ibex-35 to include Sol Melia, Uniasa.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Ibex-35 index of leading stocks will include hotel group Sol Melia and food group Uniasa from January 1, the stock exchange watchdog said on Monday.</p>
<p>These two will replace Viscofan and paper firm Ence, a member of the watchdog board told Reuters.</p>
<p>The Ibex-35 comprises Spain's largest listed companies by market capitalisation.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
